摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"PWA plugin for DeepSeek Harness — adds offline support and install-as-app capability","id":"gh:1352148584","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-pwa-plugin","slug":"RaulLazaro/dsh-pwa-plugin","topics":["deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","offline","pwa","service-worker"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"PWA plugin for DeepSeek Harness — adds offline support and install-as-app capability"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH PWA Plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"PWA plugin for DeepSeek Harness that adds offline support and install-as-app capability."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Service Worker** with smart caching strategy\n- **PWA Manifest** with proper maskable icons\n- **A"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"utomatic updates** — new versions activate silently and reload the page exactly once (a first-ever v"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"isit never reloads)\n- **Versioned caches** — cache names carry the package version, so upgrading the"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" plugin purges stale caches automatically\n- **Offline-first** for static assets\n- **Official DSH wha"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"le icon** — derived from the upstream SVG favicon"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 1. Add as a dependency"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"From npm (once published):"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Or, for a local checkout, in your DSH web profile's `package.json`:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 2. Register the plugin"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"In your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 3. Restart DSH"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Generate PNG Icons"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin ships pre-built PNG icons. To regenerate (requires sharp):"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"This reads the official `public/favicon.svg` and produces:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| File | Size | Purpose |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `icon-192.png` | 192×192 | Regular (any) |\n| `icon-192-maskable.png` | 192×192 | Maskable (20% saf"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"e zone) |\n| `icon-512.png` | 512×512 | Regular (any) |\n| `icon-512-maskable.png` | 512×512 | Maskabl"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"12.png` | 512×512 | Regular (any) |\n| `icon-512-maskable.png` | 512×512 | Maskable (20% safe zone) |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. The host plugin serves `/sw.js` (stamped with the package version), `/manifest.webmanifest`, and "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"icon files\n2. It injects a service worker registration script into the HTML\n3. The service worker pr"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e-caches static assets (one failing URL never aborts the install) and caches them for offline use\n4."},{"id":"p24s4","text":" The manifest enables installing the app as a PWA\n5. Updates are detected automatically and silently"},{"id":"p24s5","text":" activated; the page reloads once per update\n6. DSH's built-in `/favicon.svg` is used as-is (not ove"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"ed; the page reloads once per update\n6. DSH's built-in `/favicon.svg` is used as-is (not overridden)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Caching Strategy"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Resource Type | Strategy | Description |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| HTML | Network-first | Always fetches the latest version; only storable `200` responses become the"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" offline fallback |\n| JS/CSS/Fonts/Images | Cache-first | Kept in a cache named after the package ve"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"rsion, so an upgrade invalidates it without a manual version bump |\n| Dynamic DSH routes | Not inter"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"cepted | `/api`, `/auth-api`, `/oauth`, `/open-in-app`, `/plugins`, `/ws`, `/hooks` and `/dsh-pwa` a"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"lways reach the network |\n| `Cache-Control: no-store` | Never cached | The server's directive wins o"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"ver the service worker |\n| API/WebSocket | Not cached | Always goes to the network |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Requires HTTPS to work (except localhost)\n- Service worker cannot cache API calls\n- Updates requir"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"e a page reload (automatic after detection)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Project Structure"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Testing"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Zero-dependency suite on Node's built-in runner (`node --test`):"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- `test/manifest.test.mjs` — manifest required fields, icon densities (regular +\nmaskable at 192/512"},{"id":"p35s2","text":") and that every icon file exists on disk.\n- `test/sw.test.mjs` — the service worker evaluated again"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"st a fake `self`:\ninstall/activate cache lifecycle (per-URL resilient pre-cache, versioned\ncache nam"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"es, orphan cleanup), the bypass rules (non-GET, non-HTTP schemes,\n`/api`, `/auth-api`, `/oauth`, `/o"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"pen-in-app`, `/plugins`, `/ws`, `/hooks`,\n`/dsh-pwa`, websocket upgrades), network-first HTML with i"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"ts offline\nfallbacks, cache-first statics with the store guard (`200`/`basic`/\n`no-store`), and the "},{"id":"p35s7","text":"`GET_VERSION` / `SKIP_WAITING` messages.\n- `test/host.test.mjs` — route registration (sw, manifest, "},{"id":"p35s8","text":"4 icons, version),\nresponse headers, the package-version stamping of `/sw.js`, the\nindex-HTML script"},{"id":"p35s9","text":" injection, the registration script's reload guard\n(executed in a sandboxed VM), and the effect clea"},{"id":"p35s10","text":"nup used on HMR unmounts."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
